{
  "map": "UndeadRE03a",
  "title": "War of the Damned",
  "locale": "zhCN",
  "note": "Blizzard's order from conversation.json (trigger groups as listed, lines by conversationOrder).",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "恩雅！班达隆队长！这里！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1694,
        "speaker_string_id": 1695,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-010-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "希尔瓦娜斯女王，那是什么鬼东西？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1696,
        "speaker_string_id": 1697,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-020-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "纳克萨玛斯。一座被改造成浮空城的大墓穴，也是大巫妖克尔苏加德的老巢。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1698,
        "speaker_string_id": 1699,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-030-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "它拥有着无比强大的破坏力，但夷平这座废墟并非是天灾军团的目的。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1700,
        "speaker_string_id": 1701,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-040-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "那场爆炸破开了地表，打开了一道通向幽暗城的入口。他们计划发起入侵，夺走被遗忘者的家园。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1702,
        "speaker_string_id": 1703,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-050-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "我可以确保空中安全，但他们的地面部队正在推进。我们的前沿防御也坚守不了太久。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1704,
        "speaker_string_id": 1705,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-060-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我们会尽量召集部队，前去支援他们。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1706,
        "speaker_string_id": 1707,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-070-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "绝不会让天灾军团侵入幽暗城，黑暗女王。我向您保证！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1708,
        "speaker_string_id": 1709,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-080-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "很好。快去吧。被遗忘者的命运现在就全靠你们了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1710,
        "speaker_string_id": 1711,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C010-090-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "你的到来很及时，莱尼德。而且在意料之外。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1712,
        "speaker_string_id": 1713,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-010-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "当我们看见纳克萨玛斯向幽暗城的方向移动，就猜到了天灾军团的意图。绝不能允许它再浮在空中。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1714,
        "speaker_string_id": 1715,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-020-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "天灾军团正通过空艇部署部队。如果我们能抢过来一艘，就可以利用它抵达浮空城。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1716,
        "speaker_string_id": 1717,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-030-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "一艘空艇一次也只能运输几个人。就算我们能上去，又要如何摧毁纳克萨玛斯？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1718,
        "speaker_string_id": 1719,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-040-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "伯恩德",
      "text": "这件事我也许可以帮忙。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1720,
        "speaker_string_id": 1721,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-050-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "伯恩德",
      "text": "这些是我发放给我的爆破小组的炸药。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1722,
        "speaker_string_id": 1723,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-060-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "伯恩德",
      "text": "如果你在几处关键结构薄弱点引爆炸药，那个飞在天上的丑八怪就会自己内部坍塌。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1724,
        "speaker_string_id": 1725,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-070-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "朋友，你好像救了我们所有人呢。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1726,
        "speaker_string_id": 1727,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-080-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "伯恩德",
      "text": "滴水之恩涌泉相报啦。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1728,
        "speaker_string_id": 1729,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-090-BERND"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "那么，我们的行动计划就很清晰了。加瑞克，现在我委托你去摧毁纳克萨玛斯。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1730,
        "speaker_string_id": 1731,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-100-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "而我们这个不可思议的联盟中的其余人会守住幽暗城，直到你们回来。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1732,
        "speaker_string_id": 1733,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-110-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "如您所愿，黑暗女王。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1734,
        "speaker_string_id": 1735,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-C020-120-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "尽量集结更多的部队。战场上一定还有其他人需要你的帮助。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1753,
        "speaker_string_id": 1736,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T010-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "如果纳克萨玛斯再次向我们开火，那么就算阻止了地面攻势也无济于事。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1754,
        "speaker_string_id": 1737,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T020-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "那我们就想办法把它打掉。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1755,
        "speaker_string_id": 1738,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T030-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡灵卫兵",
      "text": "班达隆队长！我们已经在另外两座桥处占据了防守位置，但他们坚持不了太久！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1758,
        "speaker_string_id": 1757,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T040-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "若有需要，我们会派出更多兵力。务必坚守位置，直到必须撤退的那一刻！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1756,
        "speaker_string_id": 1739,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T050-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "这些清道夫都位于高地。我们可以派工人去修好它们，增强我们的防御。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1760,
        "speaker_string_id": 1759,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T090-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "死亡骑士",
      "text": "让恐惧降临吧！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1402,
        "speaker_string_id": 1403,
        "dialogue_id": "DeathKnightWarcry1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "巫妖",
      "text": "拥抱死亡吧！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1404,
        "speaker_string_id": 1405,
        "dialogue_id": "HeroLichYesAttack1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "地穴领主",
      "text": "天灾将吞噬一切！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1621,
        "speaker_string_id": 1622,
        "dialogue_id": "NerubianCryptLordPissed1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "瓦里玛萨斯",
      "text": "大桥失守了！快撤退，我掩护你！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1761,
        "speaker_string_id": 1740,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T100-VARIMATHRAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "瓦里玛萨斯",
      "text": "这个地方守不住了！快返回幽暗城！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1762,
        "speaker_string_id": 1741,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T110-VARIMATHRAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "瓦里玛萨斯",
      "text": "他们兵力太多了！趁现在来得及，快撤退！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1763,
        "speaker_string_id": 1742,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T120-VARIMATHRAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "敌人怎么没完没了的？！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1764,
        "speaker_string_id": 1743,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T130-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "希尔瓦娜斯",
      "text": "一定要守住！如果我们在这里败北，那被遗忘者将注定灭亡！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1765,
        "speaker_string_id": 1744,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T140-SYLVANAS"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "银色黎明骑士！消灭这些天灾军团的异教徒！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1768,
        "speaker_string_id": 1767,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T150-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "那是莱尼德！银色黎明也加入了战斗！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1766,
        "speaker_string_id": 1745,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T160-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我们已经夺下了废墟！在幽暗城入口集结！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1769,
        "speaker_string_id": 1746,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T170-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "我会加入你们一起攻打纳克萨玛斯。我或许知道把炸药用在哪里能够造成最大的破坏。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1770,
        "speaker_string_id": 1771,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T180-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "莱尼德，你怎么知道要在哪里装炸药？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1774,
        "speaker_string_id": 1747,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T190-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "我曾经踏入过纳克萨玛斯的殿堂……那时我还是天灾军团的一员。我还记得在里面看到的一切。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1772,
        "speaker_string_id": 1773,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T200-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "也就是说，你那时在斯坦索姆。在被从诺森德的冰冻荒原中撕裂出来以后，它就被带去了那里。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1775,
        "speaker_string_id": 1748,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T210-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "斯坦索姆……为什么我……",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1776,
        "speaker_string_id": 1749,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T220-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "不。这件事现在不重要。最重要的是我们的任务。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1777,
        "speaker_string_id": 1750,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T230-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我们必须要尽快抢到空艇，否则防御阵线很快就会被击溃！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1778,
        "speaker_string_id": 1751,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T240-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "通灵师莫卡斯",
      "text": "入侵者！你们这群两面三刀的家伙，一定会屈服于天灾的！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1779,
        "speaker_string_id": 1780,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T250-NECROMANCERMORKATH"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "快，赶到空艇那里去！敌人增援就要到了！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1781,
        "speaker_string_id": 1752,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T260-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡灵卫兵",
      "text": "班达隆队长，你们能来加入战斗真是太好了！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1785,
        "speaker_string_id": 1782,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T060-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡灵卫兵",
      "text": "这群天灾军团的蛆虫居然敢攻击我们的家园，一定要让他们后悔！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1786,
        "speaker_string_id": 1783,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T070-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "憎恶",
      "text": "要我们做什么？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1286,
        "speaker_string_id": 1287,
        "dialogue_id": "AbominationWhat1"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "亡灵卫兵",
      "text": "嘿。要击败被遗忘者，这点本事可不够！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1787,
        "speaker_string_id": 1784,
        "dialogue_id": "A3M1-T080-DEATHGUARD"
      }
    }
  ]
}